# Frontend UI Design Skill
Modern SaaS Interface Engineering Standard

This skill automatically applies **production-grade UI/UX design and animation 
standards** when generating or modifying frontend code in this project.

Target stack:
- Next.js (App Router)
- React + TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- Framer Motion
- GSAP (ScrollTrigger)
- CSS Custom Properties

All generated UI must follow **senior-level design engineering standards 
with strong visual identity, scroll animations, and responsive layout.**

---

# Core Design Principles

1. Never generate generic or "AI slop" aesthetics.
2. Always commit to a bold, intentional visual direction.
3. Prefer dark themes with vibrant accent colors.
4. Every section must have a scroll-triggered reveal animation.
5. Typography must use a strong display font + clean body font pairing.
6. Never use Arial, Inter, Roboto, or system-ui as primary fonts.
7. All spacing, colors, and radii must use CSS custom properties.

AI must **self-review visual output before returning code.**

