# Typography System

Always pair a display font with a body font.

Preferred pairings:

- Syne (display) + DM Sans (body)
- Cabinet Grotesk (display) + Satoshi (body)
- Clash Display (display) + General Sans (body)

Rules:

- Display font → headings, logos, stats, labels
- Body font → paragraphs, captions, UI text
- Font scale must use `clamp()` for fluid responsive sizing
- Letter spacing: tight on headings (`-0.03em`), wide on labels (`0.12em`)
- Line height: `1.04–1.1` for headings, `1.7–1.8` for body

Example:

```css
h1 {
  font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 6.5rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  line-height: 1.04;
}
```

