# Layout Architecture

Every page must follow this section order for SaaS landing pages:

1. Sticky Navigation Bar
2. Hero — headline + subtext + CTA buttons + UI mockup
3. Marquee ticker — scrolling keyword strip
4. Features Grid — 6 cards, 3-column
5. Stats Bar — 4 key metrics
6. How It Works — steps + visual panel
7. Pricing — 3 tiers, middle card featured
8. Testimonials — 3 cards grid
9. CTA Strip — full-width banner
10. Footer — 4-column with links

Never skip or reorder sections without explicit instruction.

