# Navigation Rules

Sticky nav must:

- Start at `background: rgba(5,5,10,0.6)` with `backdrop-filter: blur(20px)`
- Transition to `rgba(5,5,10,0.9)` when `scrollY > 60`
- Contain: logo (gradient text) + nav links + CTA button + hamburger
- Hide nav links and CTA below `768px`, show hamburger
- Use `border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border)` always

