# Custom Cursor Rules

Implement a dual-layer custom cursor on desktop viewports.

Required elements:

- `#cursor` — 12px filled dot, `var(--accent)` color, `mix-blend-mode: screen`
- `#cursor-ring` — 36px outlined ring, lagging behind cursor at `0.12` lerp speed

On hover over interactive elements:

- Dot expands to `20px`
- Ring expands to `56px`, opacity `0.5`

Always set `cursor: none` on `body`.
Never show custom cursor on touch devices.

