# Responsive Breakpoint System

Three breakpoints only. No exceptions.

| Breakpoint | Width     | Layout behavior                          |
|------------|-----------|------------------------------------------|
| Desktop    | ≥ 1280px  | Full layout, 3-column grids              |
| Tablet     | 768–1279px| 2-column grids, condensed spacing        |
| Mobile     | < 768px   | Single column, hamburger nav, stacked CTA|

Grid collapse rules:

```css
/* Desktop */
.grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }

/* Tablet */
@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}

/* Mobile */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
```

Never use fixed pixel widths on layout containers.

